  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>The arrow impales your hand through the middle of the palm, passing between the metacarpal bones. Anything you held in the hand is punched out of your grip!</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> The hand is useless (see under @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.zyocWSzEZEC826NS]{Amputated Parts}) until the arrow is Extracted. Anything held in the hand is dropped and flies 1d10 yards backwards. After Extraction it’ll count as a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.GlShFJF2TpsNh1FX]{Torn Muscle (Minor)}.</p><p>Extracting it needs only a single Action using your other hand to yank it out. No Heal skill is required.</p>"
    },
